@startuml
title COMP-SEQ08 UC08 会员订阅组件顺序图
autonumber
actor 用户 as U
participant "会员订阅页" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "会员订阅管理" as MEMBER
participant "订单管理" as ORDER
participant "支付管理" as PAY
U -> UI: 选择方案并确认购买
UI -> GW: 创建订阅订单
GW -> MEMBER: validatePlan(userId, creatorId, planId)
MEMBER --> GW: 方案与金额/规则错误
opt 校验通过
  GW -> ORDER: createOrder(plan, amount, idempotencyKey)
  ORDER --> GW: 待支付订单
  GW --> UI: 支付信息
  UI -> PAY: 演示支付(orderNo)
  PAY -> ORDER: confirmPayment(orderNo, amount)
  ORDER -> MEMBER: activateOrRenew(subscription)
  MEMBER --> ORDER: 订阅状态与有效期
  ORDER --> PAY: 支付处理结果
  PAY --> UI: 最终订阅结果
end
UI --> U: 显示结果
@enduml
